# D-FREED-INODE-HOME-NEVER-PUBLISHED-LIVE-CORE-AFTER-CLEAN-UNMOUNT, H-F7: a
# no-inode release unlocks a grant that the lookup node's recycled corpse kept
# and wrote through after the release's drain fence; the change rides the
# unlock undrained and is written home over the peer's free.  kdf2 (H-F8 A/B,
# 2/net/mesh/direct, production knobs, recycle guard off) traced it end to
# end: 88 touches through the kept grant during a 5.3 s fence, the unlock with
# cc 194 undrained (P-NOINO-UNLOCK-UNDRAINED cc=194 start_cc=106), the peer's
# grant and free, and the lookup node's write of the live cc-194 core 46 ms
# later (P-LOGWR-DLM-NOGRANT) -- the audited core byte for byte.
#
# Same-build A/B of module knob noino_recycle_guard (0 = control, 1 = fix),
# with the window held open by dbg_noino_postfence_delay_ms (NG0_POSTFENCE_MS):
# every no-inode release waits that long after its fence, just before it
# unlocks.  Both arms: freshsrc_keep_guard 1 and selfclobber_keep_guard 1 (the
# H-F8 and H-F8b fixes, so neither reload keep confounds), noino_gen0_guard 1,
# no generation-0 delay, mirror check on.  Runs from the sibling checkout
# carrying the fixes and the knob (its mxfs.ko, srcversion
# FAB8FDFCBFD75AFF34154F6 at launch; the harness prints each lap's build).
#
# VERDICT RULES (written before the first lap):
#   REACHED   control laps count hf7_undrained > 0 in aggregate: the held
#             window does open the hazard on this build.  If no control lap
#             does, the forcing is wrong -- redesign it before judging the fix.
#   FIX VERIFIED (H-F7)  REACHED, and every non-vacuous fix lap reads
#             hf7_keep=0, hf7_undrained=0, hf7_reset>0, audit CLEAN,
#             node_failures=0 and hf7_nogrant=0.  A nonzero hf7_nogrant in a
#             fix lap suspends the verdict until its lines are traced: a writer
#             shape other than H-F7 is its own finding and blocks the record.
#   REFUTED   any fix lap with hf7_undrained > 0, or a CORRUPT fix lap whose
#             audited inode has an undrained attribution on either node.
#   OTHER     a CORRUPT fix lap with no undrained attribution: trace that inode
#             (another mechanism); it does not judge this fix but blocks the
#             record's closure.
# A lap whose audit is STALE/NONE has no verdict and is rerun; a VACUOUS lap
# (control kept no grant / fix reset none) has no verdict.
#
# Bound per lap, the sum of the harness's own step bounds, every ssh step
# counted: prep_cluster 300 + srcversion reads 2x20 + knob sets 2x(6x20: gen0
# guard+delay, recycle, freshsrc, mirror, postfence, selfclobber) + mkdir 30 +
# workload SECS+60 = 360 + counter reads 2x40 + knob resets 2x(3x20: delay,
# mirror, postfence) + chk_clean with alloc_witness 150 + stream capture 2x120
# + snapshot 60 = 1620 s.  (The H-F8 queue's 1350 counted four knob calls per
# node where its laps make six, and no srcversion reads or mkdir.)
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=0 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmc1 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmf1 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=0 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmc2 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmf2 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=0 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmc3 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmf3 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=0 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmc4 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1620 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_POSTFENCE_MS=300 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh pmf4 1 300 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
